# The bundle's build output at the repository root: esbuild's metafile and
# the installed dependencies. The bundle itself is in fl_pi_llm/js/.
#
# Anchored to the root: an unanchored `js/` also matches fl_pi_llm/js/ and
# fl_pi_llm/rust/js/, which hold the bundle's source and the bundle itself.
/js/
